OL,5,
OL,6,FFour children had been "petrified" by a
OL,7,Fseries of attacks on their home before
OL,8,Fa petrol bomb attack killed them all,
OL,9,Fan inquest has heard.
OL,11,FDemi Pearson, 15, her brother Brandon,
OL,12,Feight, and sisters Lacie, seven, Lia,
OL,13,Fthree, died at their home in Jackson
OL,14,FStreet in Walkden in Greater Manchester
OL,15,Fin December 2017.
OL,17,FTheir mother Michelle, 37, was badly
OL,18,Fburned and died in August 2019.
