OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquest at Bolton Coroner's Court -
OL,7,Fscheduled to last eight weeks - heard
OL,8,Fthat Michelle had told police she did
OL,9,Fnot feel safe in the house, which had
OL,10,Fbeen covered in graffiti and had its
OL,11,Fwindows smashed.
